Added :meth:`FreeBusy.from_availability <icalendar.cal.free_busy.FreeBusy.from_availability>`, which computes a ready-to-send ``VFREEBUSY`` for a query window from :rfc:`7953` ``VAVAILABILITY``/``AVAILABLE`` components and actual busy periods. It handles ``PRIORITY`` combination, ``BUSYTYPE``, recurrence expansion bounded by the window, and busy-type precedence, and emits non-overlapping half-open UTC intervals.
